---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---
<Site active="about">
  <section class="hero-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr); align-items: stretch; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: linear-gradient(rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.09), rgb(255, 255, 255));">
    <div class="hero-copy" style="display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: clamp(46px, 6vw, 86px) 24px;">
      <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 860px;">
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.1); color: rgb(10, 94, 164); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 24px;">About Clairo Care</div>
        <h1 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(33px, 4.3vw, 48px); line-height: 1.07; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.036em; color: var(--clairo-navy); max-width: 24ch;">Participants deserve choice. Families deserve support. Caregivers deserve to be valued.</h1>
        <p style="margin: 20px 0px 0px; font-size: 18.5px; line-height: 29px; font-weight: 650; color: var(--clairo-blue); max-width: 48ch;">Clairo Care was built around those three ideas.</p>
        <p style="margin: 16px 0px 0px; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 26px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 54ch;">We are a Maryland DDA provider agency (and a Pennsylvania ODP provider) built to make provider services feel more human, more transparent, and more centered on the participant.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/contact"><Button size="lg">Talk to Clairo</Button></a>
          <a href="/how-it-works"><Button size="lg" variant="outline">How Clairo works</Button></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: var(--background); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px);">
      <div style="max-width: 780px;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Why we exist</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">Clairo Care exists because the traditional model wasn't working for everyone.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; margin-top: 36px;">
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 0px; overflow: hidden;">
          <div style="padding: 30px;">
            <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Our mission</h3>
            <p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Too much funding meant for care was getting eaten up by overhead, while caregivers — the people doing the hardest, most important work — were underpaid and unsupported. At the same time, the caregiver staffing crisis has made it harder for families to find and keep trusted staff, and some providers still hesitate to hire family members at all.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 0px; overflow: hidden;">
          <div style="padding: 30px;">
            <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Our plan</h3>
            <p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Instead of layering on overhead, we built a technology-first company that automates the administrative work that used to require large teams. That efficiency means more of every dollar can go to the people actually providing care.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin: 40px auto 0px; max-width: 800px; text-align: center; font-size: clamp(18px, 2.2vw, 22px); line-height: 1.55; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.015em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">At the end of the day, Clairo Care exists because families deserve better support, caregivers deserve to be valued, and we believe technology can help deliver both.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: var(--clairo-navy); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px);">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0px auto;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">What we hold to</p>
        <h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Five principles that decide how we build.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="three-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; margin-top: 38px;">
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 28px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.18); color: var(--clairo-light-blue); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;">1</div>
          <h3 style="margin: 16px 0px 8px; font-size: 17.5px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">People first</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">The participant is the point. Every process gets judged by whether it makes their life better.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 28px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.18); color: var(--clairo-light-blue); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;">2</div>
          <h3 style="margin: 16px 0px 8px; font-size: 17.5px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Trusted relationships matter</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Continuity of care is not a nice-to-have. Knowing someone well is part of supporting them well.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 28px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.18); color: var(--clairo-light-blue); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;">3</div>
          <h3 style="margin: 16px 0px 8px; font-size: 17.5px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Caregivers should be valued</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Compensation, training, and support for caregivers are the foundation of quality care.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 28px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.18); color: var(--clairo-light-blue); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;">4</div>
          <h3 style="margin: 16px 0px 8px; font-size: 17.5px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Administration should support care</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Paperwork exists to serve the work, not the other way around. We automate what we can.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 28px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.18); color: var(--clairo-light-blue); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;">5</div>
          <h3 style="margin: 16px 0px 8px; font-size: 17.5px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Transparency matters</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">We publish what we pay and say plainly what we can and cannot do.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px);">
      <div style="max-width: 740px;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">We empower I/DD families</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">People first, with trusted family and friends supporting each participant.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="three-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 34px;">
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 28px;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Hire the people who know them best</h3>
          <p style="margin: 11px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">We make it easier for families to build a care team around people the participant already trusts — our technology handles the complicated parts behind the scenes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 28px;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Simple tools, better care</h3>
          <p style="margin: 11px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Our app keeps everyone connected. Daily updates, clear schedules, and secure records mean consistent, high-quality care.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 28px;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Live fully and independently</h3>
          <p style="margin: 11px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Support is built around the goals in the participant's own plan — community, relationships, skills, and independence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: var(--background); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(54px, 7vw, 82px); padding-bottom: clamp(54px, 7vw, 82px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 760px); gap: 46px; align-items: center;">
      <div>
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Where we work</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">Maryland and Pennsylvania.</h2>
        <p class="clairo-body">Clairo Care provides services to families in Maryland through the DDA and in Pennsylvania through ODP. Available services and requirements differ between the two states.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 13px; margin-top: 22px;">
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Maryland — DDA Community Pathways services</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Pennsylvania — ODP services</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Support from a named coordinator, not a call queue</span></div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="mailto:hello@clairo.care" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750;">hello@clairo.care</a>
          <a href="tel:2406211353" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750;">(240) 621-1353</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="padding: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px) 24px 30px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div style="max-width: 1104px; margin: 0px auto; background: var(--clairo-navy); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: clamp(34px, 5vw, 58px); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <div style="max-width: 700px;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Let's talk</p>
        <h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 38px); line-height: 1.14; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Want to know if we can help your family?</h2>
        <p style="margin: 14px 0px 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">We'll be straight with you about what Clairo can and cannot do for your participant's situation.</p>
        <p style="margin: 10px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">No pressure. Just a conversation about your options.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><Button size="lg">Talk to Clairo</Button></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  </Site>
